## VM flags for the standalone binary (mix tasks are unaffected).
##
## Minimal containers often run a latin1 locale; without these the BEAM
## warns on boot and escapes non-ASCII output (the banner's em dash
## prints as \x{2014}). Cherry's input and output are UTF-8 by contract,
## whatever the host locale says.
+fnu
-kernel standard_io_encoding unicode
